  "description": "JEXVUH crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H88 Dy8 N8 O37 6+,9(C2 H6 O1),12(H2 O1),8(Cl1 1-),2(H3 O1 1+). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 14 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.491-5.092 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.22-153.05°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy8(L)4(μ3-OH)8(μ4-O)(C2H5OH)2(H2O)10]Cl8·2H3O·9C2H5OH·12H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 10 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
